100,000 subscribers on YouTube.

02:03:27.740 --> 02:03:32.130
At least that’s what I hope this is because
it does have the YouTube sticker and it did

02:03:32.130 --> 02:03:33.760
come to me in the mail.

02:03:33.760 --> 02:03:37.020
